Guile Gtk version 0.40 is now available at

 	ftp://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/guile-gtk/guile-gtk-0.40.tar.gz

Many sites around the world mirror ftp.gnu.org, please use one near
you.  For a full list see

 	http://www.gnu.org/order/ftp.html

Guile Gtk is a set of bindings for using Gtk 1.2, GdkPixbuf and Glade
in Guile.  Guile Gtk has been going for some years, but this is its
first release as an official GNU project.  The Guile Gtk home page is

 	http://www.gnu.org/software/guile-gtk

Only Gtk 1.2 is supported, not the current Gtk 2.x series.  Perhaps
this will change in the future.

