We would like to announce Batch Sender 1.1 version.
http://www.pivari.com/batch-sender.html

Batch Sender is shareware; it is a powerful command line tool, that can
run on Windows (DOS), Solaris, Linux, AIX, HPUX (if you need we can
make a special executable for other OS like Mac OS X, SCO, BSD, IRIX,
Tru64, ...) in the same way.
You need an SMTP host (in your company o in your ISP). With Batch
Sender you can use SMTP to send batch emails.
Every possible option is by command line or in the default
configuration file batchsender.cfg

