You can use STDIN for the body input: e.g.
cat file | batchsender - -to "info@pivari.com,fabrizio@pivari.com"
-from "Fabrizio Pivari <fabrizio@pivari.com>" -sub "This is a test"
-smtp 10.0.0.0

Download the demo Linux (intel) version at
http://www.pivari.com/archive/batchsenderl.tar.gz

